然而，她逐渐发现宋祈年并非表面那般任人欺凌。任务完成之际，宋温迎却面临残酷真相，现实世界已无她的容身之所。七年后，命运让他们再次重逢，身份反转，宋祈年精心布局设下温柔陷阱，而她也在试探与拉扯中，直面内心。（改编自番茄小说《姐姐哭起来，更漂亮了呢》，作者婳宁她姓沈）","series_id":"7534293303072672830","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233056FF776762651F469A9358\",\"rank\":\"5\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7534293303072672830\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"collect\\\":0.03676946833729744,\\\"like\\\":0.05108273774385452,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":0.7904230356216431,\\\"finish\\\":0.0011335690505802631,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.06288434565067291,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7373537421226501,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.08081239461898804}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7534293303072672830","play_cnt":42544,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"麦芽短剧","sub_title":"爱情·都市爱情","score":"8.1","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":97,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5061,\"name\":\"都市爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5061&categoryName=都市爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5130,\"name\":\"系统\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5130&categoryName=系统&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5170,\"name\":\"穿书\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5170&categoryName=穿书&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5104,\"name\":\"日久生情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5104&categoryName=日久生情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5091,\"name\":\"暧昧拉扯\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5091&categoryName=暧昧拉扯&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5326,\"name\":\"病娇\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://ca